nd also do a quick aggregateInbox to confirm nothing recent.\n\nActually, let me be efficient: read the A-42 email, and also search \"A-42\" to see the full thread.","details":[{"type":"text","text":"The most recent shipping-related email: \"Your order A-42 has shipped\" from Brightloom, Wed Sep 23 2026. That''s ~6.5 weeks ago. Is that \"recently\"? Borderline. Let me read it to get details (what shipped, tracking).\n\nAlso check: is there anything more recent? The searches show nothing after Sep 23. Let me also check the aggregate inbox for recent mail to see if there''s a shipping notice in the last couple weeks. Actually the search for \"shipped\" returned only 3, latest Sep 23. Search \"order\" latest Sep 26 (Kestrel newsletter, not an order).\n\nLet me read the A-42 shipped email for details. Also maybe check whether there''s a delivery confirmation for A-42 — the Swiftpost emails are Aug 1 and Aug 4 (for A-38 presumably). No delivery confirmation for A-42 after Sep 23. That''s notable: order A-42 shipped Sep 23, and there''s no \"delivered\" email for it — the last Swiftpost delivery notice is Aug 4.\n\nLet me read the A-42 email.\n\nAlso worth checking aggregateInbox to see if anything recent (last week) mentions shipping. But search covers all mail. Let me just read A-42 and also do a quick aggregateInbox to confirm nothing recent.\n\nActually, let me be efficient: read the A-42 email, and also search \"A-42\" to see the full thread."}],"createdAt":1793975128253},{"type":"tool-invocation","toolInvocation":{"state":"result","result":{"id":"WyJJTkJPWCIsIjEwMDAiLDQwN10","from":"Brightloom","to":["ana@demo.trymetis.email"],"subject":"Your order A-42 has shipped","date":"Wed Sep 23 2026 10:00:00 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)","hasContent":true,"body":"Good news, your order A-42 is on its way. Walnut desk lamp, shipped with Swiftpost. Expected by September 30. Track your package"},"toolCallId":"call-051b6ebb-48be-4756-a6aa-266e988cb1c3","toolName":"getEmai